[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0010","text":"────我要通知的事情，大概就这些了\n有什么想问的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0020","text":"没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0030","text":"我会像平时一样努力的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0040","text":"……哦，知道了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0050","text":"我等下有个会议，\n结束的时候会来接你的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0060","text":"好的，了解～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0070","text":"那，回头见"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0080","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0090","text":"像平时一样，是什么意思啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_32400200_02_0100","text":"天真"}]
